  "translation": "Today is Saturday. I go to the mall with my friend. We first take the subway and start from home. When we arrive at the mall, we go up to the second floor. There are many clothes there. My friend takes a fancy to a red top and asks the salesclerk, 'How much is this? Can it be a little cheaper?' The salesclerk says, 'One hundred yuan, it's already the cheapest.' My friend thinks it's too expensive and doesn't buy it. I take a fancy to a pair of shoes; they are very cheap and also very comfortable. I try them on, I am very satisfied, so I buy them. Then we go to the basement level to eat. There are many restaurants there; we choose one to eat noodles. After the meal we drink a cup of coffee and rest for a while. We don't go home until five o'clock in the afternoon. Today is really happy."
